Rory's cake weighs 20 ounces and is cut into 8 pieces. Each piece weighs:

\[
\frac{20}{8} = 2.5 \text{ ounces}
\]

Rory and her mom each take one piece, so 2 pieces are taken:

\[
2 \times 2.5 = 5 \text{ ounces}
\]

The remaining cake weighs:

\[
20 - 5 = 15 \text{ ounces}
\]

